OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French visits Paris to chat
OL,7,     Fto the harpsichordist, conductor
OL,8,     Fand founder of Les Talens Lyriques
OL,9,     Fabout his extraordinary career
OL,10,     Fwhich spans more than 4 decades.
